From b20b3d30bafb79cd2b25c2c6acabc21fa0ee0621 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:17:09 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(edm): add wire tool kind and gate EDM tool UI
 visibility

Add ToolKind::Wire and catalog EDM-W025, mount a wire tool on WireContour,
read wire diameter from the mounted tool while keeping machine condition agreement
checks, and hide UI tool kinds whose machine kind is neither selectable nor mounted.

Fixes #2011
